  geometry 'Point(0 0)'), 6);
                                                                     round                                                                      
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 [1.414214@Mon Jan 01 00:00:00 2001 PST, 0@Mon Jan 01 06:00:00 2001 PST, 0@Mon Jan 01 18:00:00 2001 PST, 1.414214@Tue Jan 02 00:00:00 2001 PST]
(1 row)

